    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "907712f1-6c26-4d0e-845b-8019b2f79336",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Musings Of A Manic Movie Star",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN_MOVIESET",
        "PublicId": "105471488269",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/coastaltown/_scene_copperhead.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 69e1755e-2d5c-4106-a67a-1fb37e4f9ab0).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 went to acting school along with his buddy Dino Bosco. For many years, the assassination business kept Agent 47 from following his true passion. Dino put a good word in for him, and it finally appeared to happen. Enrico Nucci, responsible for casting the actors, did not appear confident Agent 47 could do his own stunts. The pyro technicians Loggia  and Barese specifically insisted against it, as only &quot;the best can pull it off&quot;. Well, time to show them - discretly - Agent 47 can do it!",
